<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hans">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>六年级科学游戏 (Sains Y6 Games)</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #e0f7fa; /* Light blue background */
            margin: 0;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        h1 {
            color: #006064;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        p.subtitle {
            color: #00838f;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        .menu-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 500px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 15px; /* Space between buttons */
        }

        /* Styling for the links so they look like big buttons */
        .game-button {
            display: block;
            background-color: #00acc1;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            font-weight: bold;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            transition: transform 0.2s, background-color 0.2s;
        }

        /* Hover effect when the mouse goes over the button */
        .game-button:hover {
            background-color: #00838f;
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1>🔬 六年级科学小游戏 🔬</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">选择一个单元开始挑战吧！(Choose a topic to begin!)</p>

    <div class="menu-container">
        <a href="科学技能.html" class="game-button">1. 科学技能 (Science Skills)</a>
        <a href="人类.html" class="game-button">2. 人类 (Humans)</a>
        <a href="微生物.html" class="game-button">3. 微生物 (Microorganisms)</a>
        <a href="生物之间的相互关系.html" class="game-button">4. 生物之间的相互关系 (Interactions)</a>
        <a href="保护和复育.html" class="game-button">5. 保护和复育 (Preservation & Conservation)</a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
